---
// Safe to edit by hand
// The site motif under the name on the /studio loading splash
// (src/pages/studio/index.astro, PORTS.md card 120). NOT PORTABLE. For the
// Academy: the home page hero's fan of three course covers (ink, green in front,
// cream), each with its issue number in Plex Mono, its ornament and its title
// lines, standing on the spine strip of the eight cover colours that runs across
// the top of every page. Made by scripts/gen-studio-art.mjs (issue-fan.svg).
// The covers settle into their fan once, like the hero; no motion when the
// visitor asks for less. Decorative only: the parent is aria-hidden.
---

<img class="pa-fan" src="/studio-art/issue-fan.svg" alt="" width="280" height="176" />

<style>
  .pa-fan {
    margin-top: 14px;
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .pa-fan {
      animation: pa-fan-in 700ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) both;
    }
  }
  @keyframes pa-fan-in {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(10px);
    }
  }
</style>
